WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.230 --> 01:42.460
I heard lately

01:42.510 --> 01:45.490
you've been making foes everywhere.

01:45.920 --> 01:49.020
Even your fellow disciples are baffled.

01:49.040 --> 01:51.690
So the rumors are true.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.490
Beneath the Eye of the Sea,

01:57.640 --> 01:59.210
what beast is sealed?

01:59.510 --> 02:01.130
Beast? There is none.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.130
Didn't you hear

02:02.480 --> 02:03.210
the roars just now?

02:03.230 --> 02:04.460
Heard nothing.

02:06.040 --> 02:07.180
All six realms

02:07.640 --> 02:09.660
are full of fools.

02:11.310 --> 02:12.500
Pregenesis Sword.

02:12.710 --> 02:13.610
What did you say?

02:14.080 --> 02:16.060
Back then, the Grand Mage of Voidcity

02:16.280 --> 02:17.890
set up this Sea-Calming Pillar

02:17.910 --> 02:19.610
to suppress the East Sea's Eye.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.690
The Grand Mage's magical power

02:22.400 --> 02:25.610
is beyond even yours.

02:25.680 --> 02:27.940
So you can't break this seal

02:28.000 --> 02:30.100
or take the Sea-Calming Pillar.

02:31.310 --> 02:32.500
But the Pregenesis Sword can.

02:32.520 --> 02:33.290
Exactly.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.690
The Pregenesis Sword

02:34.710 --> 02:37.890
is sole magic instrument to break it.

02:37.910 --> 02:38.610
Where is it?

02:38.630 --> 02:40.380
Bear Stockade, South Sea.

02:43.120 --> 02:43.890
Yunxiao.

02:44.430 --> 02:47.010
Turn back before it's too late.

02:47.630 --> 02:48.890
If not for yourself,

02:49.000 --> 02:50.450
do it for your sect

02:50.470 --> 02:51.540
and all living souls.

02:51.560 --> 02:52.980
Don't lecture me.

02:53.710 --> 02:54.500
You're not worthy.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.260
Just a pillar.

02:58.310 --> 02:59.980
I will pull it out.

03:32.840 --> 03:34.260
Soldiers are here.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.570
Who's making the fuss?

03:47.080 --> 03:48.290
Quite a crowd.

03:56.240 --> 03:57.730
A thousand years have passed.

03:58.870 --> 04:01.260
You still won't settle down.

04:06.580 --> 04:09.500
[Episode 9]

04:09.910 --> 04:12.170
Surround the demon. Don't let her go.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.290
Kneel.

04:32.480 --> 04:33.410
That brat?

04:39.600 --> 04:40.860
He dared to scheme against me.

04:51.040 --> 04:52.100
Made it in time.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.810
You brat, I saved you

04:56.920 --> 04:58.370
and you send men to catch me?

04:58.800 --> 05:00.170
You misunderstood me.

05:00.270 --> 05:01.580
I was trying to save you.

05:02.720 --> 05:03.490
Save me?

05:04.070 --> 05:06.020
Yunxiao, no matter who lured you

05:06.070 --> 05:08.100
to the Sea-Calming Pillar,

05:08.120 --> 05:09.220
it's all a trap.

05:09.310 --> 05:10.290
Even if you succeeded,

05:10.310 --> 05:11.700
you'll suffer backlash.

05:11.800 --> 05:13.980
I said, I don't care.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.930
But Trifairy Isle folks care.

05:15.950 --> 05:17.490
Think of them.

05:17.510 --> 05:18.980
How do you know about Trifairy Isle?

05:22.480 --> 05:24.290
Alright, you're here now.

05:24.310 --> 05:25.490
Speak your mind.

05:28.040 --> 05:31.290
Fairy Yunxiao is not heartless.

05:33.430 --> 05:34.900
Everything she did

05:34.920 --> 05:36.660
was beyond her control.

05:38.120 --> 05:39.290
A person,

05:39.510 --> 05:41.900
if forced against their will,

05:41.920 --> 05:44.980
must have someone they love.

05:46.830 --> 05:48.410
And loved ones

05:48.600 --> 05:50.370
are Moon Elder's specialty.

05:50.510 --> 05:53.050
So, please find us

05:53.070 --> 05:55.250
who Yunxiao cares about.

05:55.250 --> 05:56.170
He...

05:56.190 --> 05:57.370
Could he?

05:57.920 --> 05:59.220
He's Moon Elder.

05:59.240 --> 06:00.930
He only handles marriages.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.490
Only ties red strings.

06:02.510 --> 06:03.370
He can't handle this.

06:03.390 --> 06:04.660
Not so.

06:05.070 --> 06:08.900
Eastwood Duke,
family bonds are fate too.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.050
Red strings are for marriage

06:11.310 --> 06:13.980
but I don't just have red ones.

06:14.070 --> 06:14.900
I got

06:18.000 --> 06:20.140
black, white, green, blue, orange,

06:20.190 --> 06:22.140
patterned, yellow, yours, mine, his,

06:22.160 --> 06:24.050
big, small, thick, thin...

06:24.870 --> 06:25.660
Fine.

06:28.000 --> 06:28.930
Checking for you.

06:29.120 --> 06:29.730
I...

06:31.240 --> 06:33.020
Yunxiao, just think.

06:33.040 --> 06:34.250
If you perish in the East Sea,

06:34.270 --> 06:35.980
what about Trifairy Isle?

06:36.070 --> 06:37.220
They'd be heartbroken.

06:37.870 --> 06:40.250
But if I don't do this,

06:40.720 --> 06:42.100
do you know what I'll lose?

06:42.600 --> 06:45.610
Yunxiao, taking by force

06:45.720 --> 06:47.100
isn't the best way.

06:47.430 --> 06:48.610
You're brilliant.

06:48.630 --> 06:49.900
You should understand.

06:51.480 --> 06:53.410
Pearl Elites, form up.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.900
Nothing to do with me.

07:02.270 --> 07:04.700
You stormed in and burned Lotus Hall.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.810
You must be punished.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.700
What punishment do I deserve?

07:08.720 --> 07:11.020
You demon. Think we stand unguarded?

07:15.920 --> 07:17.850
Yunxiao, do not be rash.

07:18.120 --> 07:18.900
Si'er.

07:19.270 --> 07:20.370
Demon, stop!

07:20.480 --> 07:21.290
Don't hurt her.

07:21.870 --> 07:22.700
Don't hurt her.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.580
Speak. Speak.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.780
Your Highness, now.

07:31.260 --> 07:36.140
[Token]

07:48.510 --> 07:49.290
Yunxiao.

07:51.310 --> 07:52.900
Survive. Don't let them use you.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.050
Si'er.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.580
The First Prince beat the Demon.

08:17.240 --> 08:18.700
The First Prince beat the Demon.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.100
The First Prince is a hero.

08:21.310 --> 08:22.610
The First Prince is a hero.

08:22.920 --> 08:24.250
The First Prince is a hero.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.580
The First Prince is mighty.

08:26.870 --> 08:28.460
The First Prince beat the Demon.

08:31.920 --> 08:35.100
Was all this Your Majesty's plan?

08:36.510 --> 08:40.060
Truly brilliant and farsighted.

08:40.320 --> 08:42.770
Stopped a war before it started.

08:43.910 --> 08:46.300
Even if I train another thousand years,

08:46.510 --> 08:48.610
I couldn't match a hair on your head.

08:48.720 --> 08:49.890
Even with ten thousand more years,

08:49.910 --> 08:52.490
couldn't match a single scale.

08:55.510 --> 08:57.100
I didn't plan a thing.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.300
Well...

08:59.320 --> 09:02.340
Your Majesty is blessed by fate.

09:02.390 --> 09:03.890
Any disaster before you

09:03.910 --> 09:05.490
turns into good luck.

09:05.720 --> 09:07.100
Just one thing.

09:07.510 --> 09:09.490
Why tell Fairy Yunxiao

09:09.510 --> 09:11.250
about the Pregenesis Sword?

09:15.120 --> 09:17.490
A feud is best settled than deepened.

09:17.960 --> 09:19.300
Let her be.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.180
To end things this way,

09:22.600 --> 09:24.180
it is just perfect.

09:25.390 --> 09:26.890
But what a pity.

09:27.080 --> 09:27.940
A pity for what?

09:28.000 --> 09:30.100
A fair maiden, of course.

09:30.360 --> 09:31.130
A fair maiden?

09:31.480 --> 09:35.100
She's the first blush of cloud
at the Dawn of Creation.

09:35.670 --> 09:38.850
Heavenreach Master's top disciple.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.490
The youngest Quasi-Saint
in the Three Realms.

09:42.120 --> 09:44.700
With her talent and fortune,

09:44.790 --> 09:46.300
if she stayed the path,

09:46.320 --> 09:50.010
she'd live forever, revered by all.

09:50.720 --> 09:53.460
But darkness possessed her,

09:53.480 --> 09:56.300
making her ruthless and fall from grace.

09:57.480 --> 10:00.250
Such a tragic waste.

10:12.030 --> 10:12.820
Yunxiao.

10:13.360 --> 10:14.060
Yunxiao.

10:17.630 --> 10:18.340
Yunxiao.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.460
You finally answered.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.650
Where'd you go?

10:22.080 --> 10:23.420
Scratched, bumped, hurt?

10:23.440 --> 10:24.300
Anyone else hurt?

10:24.480 --> 10:25.220
Brother,

10:25.390 --> 10:27.010
stop nagging.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.130
I just felt like

10:29.360 --> 10:30.650
causing a little chaos.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.980
Chaos again?

10:32.720 --> 10:34.300
You and your chaos.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.890
Next time, bring me along.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.300
We'll make it bigger.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.490
Remember.

10:39.120 --> 10:41.180
Never cause chaos alone.

10:41.910 --> 10:43.980
Two is better.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.650
If that's not enough,

10:46.320 --> 10:47.850
our sect has tons. Call more backup.

10:47.870 --> 10:48.530
No.

10:48.670 --> 10:50.850
This isn't about you, Bixiao, Qiongxiao,

10:51.120 --> 10:52.650
or our sect.

10:52.720 --> 10:54.010
I must do it alone.

10:54.910 --> 10:56.650
Why so serious for a little chaos?

10:58.030 --> 10:58.820
You lost weight.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.580
Dark circles too.

11:00.910 --> 11:01.650
Not eating well?

11:01.670 --> 11:03.100
Brother? Brother?

11:03.120 --> 11:03.980
I'm right here.

11:04.510 --> 11:05.180
Can't you see me?

11:05.200 --> 11:05.770
Brother?

11:05.790 --> 11:06.490
You just touched me.

11:06.510 --> 11:07.220
Brother?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.220
Don't pull that with me.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.340
The spiritual energy here is thin.

11:09.360 --> 11:10.100
- You know?
- Stop it.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.100
Wait. What?

11:11.120 --> 11:12.530
Mine's full, alright?

11:12.600 --> 11:15.940
I can't hear you.

11:16.120 --> 11:16.770
Don't press that.

11:30.030 --> 11:32.770
No wonder that brat tracked me.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.700
You brat!

11:41.720 --> 11:44.580
Brat!

11:45.670 --> 11:47.100
The First Prince is a hero.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.820
The First Prince is a hero.

11:49.790 --> 11:51.820
The First Prince is a hero. So mighty.

11:54.000 --> 11:55.940
I'll sleep and claim credit
at the Celestial Court.

11:56.000 --> 11:57.490
Might solve my problems
once and for all.

12:00.000 --> 12:00.770
Li Changshou.

12:01.390 --> 12:02.490
Li Changshou, open up.

12:04.630 --> 12:05.650
Open up, Li Changshou.

12:12.790 --> 12:14.850
Weird. Why can't I break 'em down?

12:23.870 --> 12:25.650
Other doors are like paper.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.580
Why are yours so sturdy?

12:29.030 --> 12:31.130
General Yecha, what brings you here

12:31.150 --> 12:32.300
so late?

12:32.510 --> 12:34.060
Still playing dumb?

12:34.240 --> 12:35.890
You know what you did.

12:39.030 --> 12:40.300
What did I do?

12:40.670 --> 12:41.850
Let's have a drink.

12:42.000 --> 12:43.220
Didn't we agree?

12:43.240 --> 12:45.220
You help me deal with Fairy Yunxiao,

12:45.240 --> 12:46.890
and I'll treat you to a drink.

12:50.000 --> 12:52.010
General, that was just a joke.

12:52.030 --> 12:53.300
Why take it seriously?

12:53.840 --> 12:54.890
I'm a bit tired, actually.

12:54.910 --> 12:55.940
I just want to sleep.

12:55.960 --> 12:56.700
No way.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.700
I don't owe debts.

12:59.120 --> 12:59.940
Like it or not,

13:00.000 --> 13:02.300
you're drinking with me.

13:02.440 --> 13:04.220
General, I'd like to sleep.

13:09.720 --> 13:10.300
Here.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.180
I'll go first.

13:19.120 --> 13:21.250
You can hold your liquor.

13:21.630 --> 13:24.220
Matched me without flinching.

13:25.510 --> 13:28.100
Booze tastes all the same.

13:28.200 --> 13:28.980
Awful.

13:30.480 --> 13:31.890
Then why drink so much?

13:32.600 --> 13:34.100
To keep you company.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.610
Besides,

13:35.790 --> 13:37.940
it's natural rough guys drink.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.610
I look so vicious for nothing?

13:39.910 --> 13:41.940
If the fish and shrimp saw

13:41.960 --> 13:43.060
I don't touch booze,

13:43.200 --> 13:44.580
they'd laugh at me.

13:45.390 --> 13:46.940
Over time,

13:47.790 --> 13:48.820
I got used to it.

13:48.840 --> 13:51.370
Just plug my nose and chug.

13:53.910 --> 13:54.820
That's true.

13:55.870 --> 13:58.820
The charm lies in its harshness.

14:00.720 --> 14:02.250
Sorting out everything in life

14:02.910 --> 14:04.250
isn't any fun anyway.

14:07.840 --> 14:09.300
Well said.

14:10.390 --> 14:13.770
You look so frail,

14:14.030 --> 14:15.890
but you always drop

14:16.080 --> 14:17.700
interesting weird wisdom.

14:19.120 --> 14:21.180
If all humans were like you,

14:21.510 --> 14:22.650
we wouldn't

14:22.720 --> 14:24.770
need to fight, right?

14:25.790 --> 14:28.490
The feud started in ancient times.

14:28.910 --> 14:30.300
Settling it now

14:30.440 --> 14:32.060
makes everyone miserable.

14:34.320 --> 14:35.890
Dragon King thinks so too, right?

14:38.670 --> 14:41.250
How do you know His Majesty's mind?

14:41.910 --> 14:44.250
Why else would he invite

14:44.270 --> 14:46.490
Ascendance Sect to make peace?

14:47.320 --> 14:49.490
And let the First Prince
who hates humans most

14:49.510 --> 14:50.980
lead this peace process?

14:51.510 --> 14:53.010
Isn't it to make him understand

14:53.270 --> 14:55.250
that human-dragon peace was hard-won?

14:58.270 --> 14:59.300
Impressive.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.610
I'll be honest with you.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.300
Originally, the First Prince

15:06.320 --> 15:08.010
didn't plan on letting you go back.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.650
But this time,

15:09.720 --> 15:12.820
you've done great work here.

15:13.670 --> 15:15.060
The First Prince agreed

15:15.320 --> 15:17.850
to send you off tomorrow morning.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.420
The items in Lotus Hall,

15:20.790 --> 15:21.770
if any catch your eye,

15:22.550 --> 15:23.420
take your pick.

15:26.080 --> 15:27.010
General Yecha.

15:27.910 --> 15:30.100
Are you this honest with everyone?

15:35.480 --> 15:37.060
What? Not used to it?

15:37.510 --> 15:38.300
Not that.

15:39.240 --> 15:41.490
Aren't you scared leaking secrets

15:42.000 --> 15:43.460
will get your butt kicked by the Prince?

15:45.630 --> 15:46.820
You know that too?

15:50.320 --> 15:52.490
My biggest dream in life

15:52.510 --> 15:55.300
is to take a few blades for him.

15:56.670 --> 15:59.460
Even if I die, worth it.

15:59.510 --> 16:01.220
What's a few kicks to the butt?

16:04.600 --> 16:07.420
Such a humble dream.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.770
Truth is, I do have a dream.

16:14.200 --> 16:14.980
Let's hear it.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.220
I want a name.

16:20.120 --> 16:20.890
A name?

16:22.440 --> 16:24.100
Us river spirits

16:24.120 --> 16:25.700
have no names.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.130
Born shrimp, you're a shrimp soldier.

16:27.200 --> 16:28.770
And crab, a crab general.

16:29.840 --> 16:32.490
"Yecha" is just a general label.

16:40.000 --> 16:42.700
What about you? Your dream?

16:44.200 --> 16:45.220
My dream?

16:47.390 --> 16:48.700
My dream

16:51.480 --> 16:52.460
is to live.

16:55.320 --> 16:57.220
You dying or something?

16:58.320 --> 17:01.010
I mean living safe and sound.

17:01.120 --> 17:02.100
Surviving.

17:02.910 --> 17:04.460
Seeking immortality, pursuing the Way,

17:04.510 --> 17:06.900
and seeing all the world's beauty.

17:09.110 --> 17:11.250
Beats me. I don't get it.

17:12.110 --> 17:14.290
Anyway, I think you can do it now.

17:15.200 --> 17:17.180
Buddy, stop hesitating.

17:17.240 --> 17:19.570
Wait too long, the flavor's gone.

17:37.000 --> 17:39.380
Your Yecha tribe lives long.

17:39.790 --> 17:41.660
How can you know

17:41.680 --> 17:43.660
how us fleeting humans feel?

17:43.680 --> 17:46.490
Just struggling against fate

17:46.510 --> 17:47.490
without drowning

17:47.510 --> 17:49.460
takes all our strength.

17:50.400 --> 17:52.700
If I stopped

17:52.880 --> 17:54.490
to enjoy the scenery

17:54.510 --> 17:55.570
along the way,

17:57.000 --> 17:58.570
that'd be way too luxurious.

18:09.270 --> 18:10.090
This Yecha

18:12.400 --> 18:13.700
looks fierce

18:14.830 --> 18:16.050
but has a good heart.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.860
If you ever visit Ascendance Sect,

18:20.440 --> 18:21.700
I'll buy you good booze.

18:26.830 --> 18:27.620
Cheers.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.900
So awful.

18:58.440 --> 19:00.530
Well, after that drink,

19:00.550 --> 19:02.460
I woke up feeling terrible.

19:03.480 --> 19:05.010
Please check me out.

19:05.480 --> 19:08.700
General, stay calm. Just upset stomach.

19:10.200 --> 19:11.090
Upset stomach?

19:11.720 --> 19:14.290
General, exhaustion and heavy booze

19:14.480 --> 19:16.980
set your system on fire,
making you hurl and purge.

19:17.310 --> 19:20.050
It's not fatal, but still be careful.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.860
Okay. Got it.

19:27.270 --> 19:28.460
That is why I always say,

19:28.720 --> 19:30.050
you're not a physician,

19:30.070 --> 19:32.490
but a merciful immortal.

19:32.920 --> 19:35.490
Sir, would you name me?

19:35.640 --> 19:37.570
Don't like being called Yecha?

19:37.680 --> 19:39.090
In my teachings,

19:39.310 --> 19:42.220
the Yecha clan are noble guardians.

19:42.240 --> 19:43.570
Grand and majestic.

19:44.310 --> 19:46.490
Perfect for a Royal Guard.

19:47.110 --> 19:48.900
Those teachings of yours...

19:48.920 --> 19:50.660
Where did they come from?

19:50.720 --> 19:52.700
Every time I ask, you never tell.

19:53.030 --> 19:55.460
When His Highness takes the tallies

19:55.590 --> 19:57.010
and resumes troop reviews

19:57.110 --> 19:59.290
to discuss declaring war on humans,

20:00.070 --> 20:02.810
I'll tell you then.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.380
That day will never come.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.050
How so?

20:11.640 --> 20:12.980
They just don't want to fight.

20:14.000 --> 20:16.570
Honestly, humans aren't as arrogant

20:16.590 --> 20:17.460
as rumors say.

20:17.480 --> 20:19.090
Everyone living in peace,

20:19.110 --> 20:20.620
isn't that good?

20:20.790 --> 20:22.660
Plus, I can tell

20:22.920 --> 20:24.570
His Highness feels the same.

20:24.790 --> 20:27.290
Just hasn't confirmed it yet.

20:27.790 --> 20:30.700
Didn't you say peace comes first?

20:34.310 --> 20:35.530
Hearing these words

20:35.680 --> 20:38.180
from a vanguard against humans

20:38.550 --> 20:42.010
pleasantly surprises me.

20:42.270 --> 20:42.770
Yes.

20:44.070 --> 20:47.380
I heard it was your plan

20:47.720 --> 20:48.900
to drive Yunxiao out.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.380
You heard too?

20:52.000 --> 20:53.700
Don't let my big size fool you.

20:53.720 --> 20:56.860
I drop good tactics sometimes.

20:58.720 --> 21:01.010
You did a great service.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.140
I'm flattered.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.490
Great service? Nah.

21:03.830 --> 21:05.490
All for the East Sea.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.900
General, please lie down.

21:09.200 --> 21:11.620
I'll do your final treatment.

21:11.920 --> 21:12.700
Alright.

21:20.070 --> 21:20.860
General.

21:22.030 --> 21:24.810
I thought of a name that suits you.

21:25.030 --> 21:25.900
How about

21:26.920 --> 21:28.250
Mighty Whale?

21:28.440 --> 21:29.250
Mighty Whale.

21:31.200 --> 21:34.770
Love it. A mighty whale slays foes.

21:34.920 --> 21:35.700
So badass.

21:36.110 --> 21:36.900
Lie back.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.090
Okay.

21:38.110 --> 21:40.380
That's not what I mean.

21:41.590 --> 21:42.730
When a whale falls,

21:43.440 --> 21:45.090
all life thrives.

21:49.110 --> 21:50.460
Mortals suffer endless trials,

21:50.480 --> 21:52.250
tormenting themselves in pain.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.330
General.

21:54.070 --> 21:55.090
From all suffering,

21:55.310 --> 21:56.860
I shall set you free.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.620
I told him so many times

22:52.200 --> 22:53.490
yet he never listens.

22:54.200 --> 22:56.730
For the dragons,
no obstacles can remain.

22:56.880 --> 22:59.010
Farewell, General Yecha.

22:59.270 --> 23:02.010
I meant only to guide the tide,

23:02.830 --> 23:04.420
not stir waves from nothing.

23:04.640 --> 23:08.220
This blood debt mars my Nine Cycles.

23:16.750 --> 23:18.090
From here on,

23:19.830 --> 23:21.940
I'll leave it to you.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.420
General Yecha.

23:44.440 --> 23:46.220
He is...

23:51.350 --> 23:52.140
Jinli.

23:53.790 --> 23:54.810
Repeat what you just said

23:56.480 --> 23:57.290
one more time.

23:58.440 --> 23:59.220
Yes.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.490
At midnight,

24:02.240 --> 24:04.180
Yecha drank with an Ascendance Sect man.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.980
Soon, he fell into enemy hands

24:06.790 --> 24:07.700
and died on the spot.

24:07.750 --> 24:08.700
Is this truly so?

24:09.880 --> 24:11.420
No. That cannot be.

24:11.880 --> 24:14.250
Your Highness, Dragon Gate isn't open.

24:14.270 --> 24:16.380
Ascendance Sect can't flee the palace.

24:16.400 --> 24:17.380
Do you mean

24:18.030 --> 24:19.660
I'm framing them?

24:23.960 --> 24:24.980
Master Jin Chan.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.860
What's your verdict?

24:33.240 --> 24:35.090
I've examined him.

24:37.030 --> 24:38.660
A deadly toxin was in the liquor.

24:39.030 --> 24:41.220
Human's Heart-Piercing Salve.

24:41.550 --> 24:43.180
His wounds

24:43.720 --> 24:45.810
match the human spell used

24:46.240 --> 24:48.250
when we visited Ascendance Sect.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.420
A human spell?

24:55.830 --> 24:58.420
Master Jin Chan, are you sure?

24:58.750 --> 25:01.090
After he returned last time,

25:01.960 --> 25:04.420
I treated his wounds.

25:04.750 --> 25:06.380
I am sure

25:07.750 --> 25:09.620
it was the same spell.

25:11.030 --> 25:11.900
So,

25:12.960 --> 25:13.860
they knew General Yecha

25:13.880 --> 25:15.420
couldn't be reached when sober.

25:16.790 --> 25:18.010
So they poisoned him first,

25:19.750 --> 25:20.530
then attacked.

25:25.200 --> 25:25.940
Your Highness.

25:26.310 --> 25:27.770
My condolences.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.330
What?

25:40.830 --> 25:41.460
Your Highness.

25:41.480 --> 25:42.420
My apologies.

25:42.440 --> 25:44.090
I can't handle being lifted up.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.530
My Yecha

25:46.000 --> 25:47.330
is one of a kind.

25:55.440 --> 25:56.490
Luminous Pearl.

25:58.200 --> 26:00.010
This one's awesome.

26:00.030 --> 26:01.090
We have to take it.

26:01.790 --> 26:02.620
Look at them.

26:02.640 --> 26:04.420
So clueless.

26:05.590 --> 26:08.420
His Majesty said, to quell the strife,

26:08.590 --> 26:11.220
these treasures are gifted to your sect.

26:11.400 --> 26:12.980
We appreciate it.

26:15.310 --> 26:16.900
Wang Qi, can you carry all that?

26:16.920 --> 26:17.620
All you do is grab.

26:18.590 --> 26:19.620
Aunt, here.

26:21.110 --> 26:22.330
Listen, in a bit,

26:22.350 --> 26:24.050
take this, this, this.

26:24.160 --> 26:24.940
Take them all for me.

26:24.960 --> 26:26.180
I'll grab them later.

26:26.200 --> 26:26.980
Okay.

26:33.640 --> 26:34.420
Senior.

26:34.920 --> 26:35.980
Why so sleepy?

26:37.640 --> 26:38.490
Look at that.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.860
I was forced to drink. Up all night.

26:41.880 --> 26:44.570
Where are the First Prince
and General Yecha?

26:46.030 --> 26:47.420
The First Prince being here is enough.

26:47.440 --> 26:50.290
That Yecha's rude and ugly.

26:50.680 --> 26:51.570
Better without him.

26:53.310 --> 26:55.420
Neither of them is here.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.770
Feels off somehow.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.770
His Highness will open the Dragon Gate.

27:00.790 --> 27:03.220
Are all the envoys present?

27:06.310 --> 27:08.420
Only Uncle Kuai Si is missing.

27:08.550 --> 27:10.010
That Kuai Si.

27:10.110 --> 27:11.860
Usually so sharp. What's wrong today?

27:11.880 --> 27:12.620
Oversleeping?

27:25.830 --> 27:27.380
Your sect is about to suffer.

27:28.160 --> 27:29.770
You're completely unmoved?

27:31.350 --> 27:35.330
None of them are from Mistveil Division.

27:37.590 --> 27:38.330
Sir,

27:39.510 --> 27:40.770
what a cold heart.

27:42.240 --> 27:44.730
That demon helped me survive
the Aureate Immortal Tribulation.

27:45.590 --> 27:47.900
I worked for your scheme in return.

27:48.400 --> 27:51.900
It's business. No heart involved.

27:55.350 --> 27:57.290
I dislike men like you.

27:59.000 --> 28:03.380
Because I watch my sect get slaughtered?

28:05.880 --> 28:06.530
No.

28:07.960 --> 28:10.220
Because you're boring.

28:11.510 --> 28:12.900
Boring?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.660
Can fun feed you?

28:17.200 --> 28:18.330
Over there.

28:18.640 --> 28:20.730
They're more amusing.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.460
Nobody moves.

28:30.310 --> 28:32.010
Suspects from the Ascendance Sect.

28:32.030 --> 28:33.220
Take them all to the Eastern Palace.

28:33.240 --> 28:34.980
For His Highness to interrogate.

28:35.440 --> 28:36.490
You seafood.

28:36.550 --> 28:37.980
How are we suspects?

28:38.000 --> 28:39.250
Make it clear.

28:39.270 --> 28:42.010
General Yecha was poisoned by you.

28:42.240 --> 28:43.860
Proof is solid. Still denying it?

28:44.400 --> 28:45.530
General Yecha?

28:46.640 --> 28:47.570
Nonsense.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.220
Elder Kuai Si is coming.

28:49.240 --> 28:51.420
We'll explain to the First Prince.

28:51.440 --> 28:52.700
You dare mention Kuai Si?

28:53.270 --> 28:55.290
Room's empty. He fled.

28:56.310 --> 28:57.090
Fled?

28:58.550 --> 29:00.700
Human suspects refuse to confess.

29:01.030 --> 29:02.940
If we tolerate your arrogance,

29:03.030 --> 29:05.420
how can we face Yecha's soul?

29:05.920 --> 29:07.090
All soldiers.

29:07.440 --> 29:08.900
Arrest them all.

29:08.920 --> 29:10.770
Kill those who resist.

29:10.790 --> 29:11.420
Yes.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.330
Senior disciples, engage.

29:14.790 --> 29:16.050
Junior disciples, fall back.

29:16.070 --> 29:16.770
Let's go.

29:18.350 --> 29:18.940
Attack.

29:29.510 --> 29:31.090
I persuaded Fairy Yunxiao to leave.

29:31.110 --> 29:33.010
The Mastermind, shamed into rage,

29:33.310 --> 29:35.250
framing us with this poison scheme.

29:35.750 --> 29:37.050
Senior, what do we do now?

29:37.550 --> 29:38.460
Now, the only way

29:38.680 --> 29:40.050
is escaping the Dragon Palace.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.220
How?

29:45.720 --> 29:48.700
Dragon Palace has only one entrance.

29:48.720 --> 29:52.730
The water whirlwind is the Dragon Gate.

29:53.160 --> 29:56.530
Only the Dragon Gate Token

29:56.720 --> 30:01.290
or royal dragon blood can open it.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.660
Dragon Gate Token or royal dragon blood.

30:03.830 --> 30:05.420
Junior, cover me.

30:05.440 --> 30:06.090
All right.

30:09.200 --> 30:10.730
Senior, what's your plan?

30:11.240 --> 30:11.860
Sleep.

30:12.000 --> 30:12.770
Sleep.

30:13.030 --> 30:13.810
Sleep?

30:14.070 --> 30:14.860
Senior.

30:34.880 --> 30:35.770
Changshou.

30:36.830 --> 30:39.250
This Stellar Dreamweaver

30:39.720 --> 30:42.620
is worth 3,000 years of my work.

30:43.270 --> 30:44.730
Use it carefully.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.220
Understood.

30:54.200 --> 30:54.980
Speak.

31:01.240 --> 31:02.490
Dragon Palace of the East Sea.

31:05.270 --> 31:06.570
Glitched a bit. No biggie.

31:06.590 --> 31:07.250
Speak.

31:08.270 --> 31:10.900
Ao Yi, Second Prince of the East Sea.

31:12.440 --> 31:13.530
His star's bright.

31:13.830 --> 31:15.420
Still asleep in dream.

31:17.640 --> 31:19.220
All set. Go.

31:19.640 --> 31:20.420
Okay.

31:24.070 --> 31:25.620
Is this thing safe?

31:26.350 --> 31:28.490
Barely. It's an antique.

31:28.790 --> 31:29.570
Okay.

31:43.380 --> 31:46.900
[My Future Self By Ao Yi Age 4]

31:52.980 --> 31:59.740
[Ao Yi's Dream]

32:12.240 --> 32:13.460
Dragon Prince Ao Yi.

32:15.310 --> 32:17.810
I have urgent news.

32:17.830 --> 32:19.770
Super urgent. Wake up.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.620
Wake up. You're dying.

32:28.160 --> 32:29.460
My fate is my own.

32:32.070 --> 32:35.050
Never mock a poor youth.

32:35.510 --> 32:37.620
Almost forgot. He digs this stuff.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.860
Break through the darkness, young one.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.330
What's going on?

32:46.920 --> 32:47.700
Where am I?

32:48.960 --> 32:49.730
Who are you?

32:55.880 --> 32:56.860
Young lady.

32:57.790 --> 32:59.290
Why bother?

33:00.070 --> 33:01.420
You have no magic.

33:01.440 --> 33:03.180
How can you beat us?

33:08.400 --> 33:09.900
Someone once asked me

33:11.440 --> 33:13.420
why I draw my sword.

33:14.640 --> 33:16.140
Only at this moment

33:17.440 --> 33:18.730
do I understand.

33:20.030 --> 33:21.730
It's to protect those behind me.

33:37.830 --> 33:38.860
Senior Changshou.

33:39.680 --> 33:40.900
I finally get it.

33:43.030 --> 33:43.940
Sir.

33:44.310 --> 33:45.460
Enlighten me again.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.090
General Yecha is dead?

33:48.310 --> 33:51.620
The dragons now face a grand scheme.

33:51.640 --> 33:54.250
Human-dragon strife has long simmered

33:54.310 --> 33:56.220
and used by malicious schemers.

33:56.240 --> 33:58.010
The fuse is about to be lit.

33:58.030 --> 34:00.420
War is about to break out.

34:01.030 --> 34:04.220
In this crisis, I can do nothing.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.860
Wrong.

34:06.310 --> 34:07.570
The way I see it,

34:07.790 --> 34:08.570
you are

34:08.590 --> 34:10.300
the dragon to break this deadlock.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.010
Me?

34:11.590 --> 34:12.260
Really?

34:12.360 --> 34:13.690
Absolutely.

34:13.840 --> 34:17.690
Your spirit roots are weak for now,

34:18.110 --> 34:20.210
but you bear the Dragon's Prophecy.

34:20.230 --> 34:22.170
You are the chosen one.

34:25.480 --> 34:26.490
What should I do?

34:26.550 --> 34:27.610
Open the Dragon Gate.

34:28.710 --> 34:29.490
Dragon Gate?

34:30.360 --> 34:32.900
You want me to open the Dragon Gate

34:33.230 --> 34:35.460
to let humans escape this calamity?

34:35.480 --> 34:36.260
Exactly.

34:38.840 --> 34:39.610
I can't.

34:40.590 --> 34:41.380
What?

34:41.800 --> 34:43.610
I bear the prophecy,

34:45.150 --> 34:46.460
but I'm just a little dragon.

34:46.480 --> 34:48.610
I never won in sparring.

34:48.630 --> 34:50.300
Even if my brother didn't...

34:51.510 --> 34:52.260
Why'd you smack me?

34:52.280 --> 34:53.900
Scared of everything even in dreams.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.740
Smacking me hurts in dreams too?

34:56.760 --> 34:57.980
Listen up.

34:58.150 --> 35:00.050
You're trapped by inner demons.

35:00.070 --> 35:01.090
Look at yourself.

35:01.110 --> 35:03.010
You're already a big dragon,

35:03.030 --> 35:04.900
yet timid and self-limiting.

35:05.920 --> 35:06.690
Look at me.

35:07.030 --> 35:08.340
Believe in yourself.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.900
You can do it.

35:10.030 --> 35:10.740
I...

35:11.360 --> 35:12.210
I can?

35:13.920 --> 35:15.130
Yes, you can.

35:16.230 --> 35:17.090
I can do it.

35:17.230 --> 35:18.010
Exactly.

35:19.030 --> 35:20.050
The situation is urgent.

35:20.110 --> 35:23.170
Your brother's
hunting Ascendance disciples.

35:23.630 --> 35:25.650
No time to lose. Seize the chance.

35:25.670 --> 35:27.380
Beat your rivals to prove yourself.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.090
Okay.

35:28.960 --> 35:30.210
But have we met somewhere?

35:30.230 --> 35:31.380
You look so familiar.

35:34.230 --> 35:37.090
Senior, wake up.

35:38.780 --> 35:39.500
[Lotus Hall Treasure Catalog]

35:39.510 --> 35:40.300
This is the token.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.420
Stick to the plan.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.460
Just remember:

35:42.630 --> 35:43.610
Make it quick.

35:45.110 --> 35:46.050
Something over there?

35:55.400 --> 35:56.380
Got it.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.340
Senior, wake up.

35:58.360 --> 35:59.210
We're in danger.

35:59.230 --> 36:00.210
Wake up.

36:00.230 --> 36:01.130
There. Found them.

36:02.230 --> 36:02.610
Hurry.

36:02.630 --> 36:03.380
Please.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.650
Senior, wake up.

36:04.670 --> 36:06.050
Senior, it's urgent.

36:06.070 --> 36:06.650
What's going on?

36:07.760 --> 36:08.130
You...

36:10.840 --> 36:11.860
Let's do this.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.610
Easy. Not the face.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.010
Over there.

36:37.030 --> 36:37.900
Not again.

36:43.400 --> 36:44.090
Got it.

36:45.510 --> 36:46.380
Got it.

36:53.190 --> 36:53.900
Just a dream.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.340
No, it's not a dream.

37:32.000 --> 37:32.530
Are you alright?

37:32.590 --> 37:33.210
I'm fine.

37:33.230 --> 37:34.420
Senior, you found a way out?

37:35.000 --> 37:35.740
Sort of.

37:36.000 --> 37:36.900
I'm heading out.

37:37.000 --> 37:38.210
Find a place to hide.

37:41.710 --> 37:42.820
Senior, I'm hidden.

37:50.510 --> 37:51.610
Are you looking for me?

37:53.400 --> 37:54.740
Him. That's him.

37:54.840 --> 37:56.860
He drank with General Yecha last night.

37:56.880 --> 37:57.820
You're right.

37:58.920 --> 37:59.340
Get him.

38:02.920 --> 38:04.420
Changshou, you're weak.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.610
You can't beat them.

38:09.920 --> 38:10.740
Stop.

38:11.280 --> 38:11.940
It's Forbidden Land.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.420
You can't enter, right?

38:13.660 --> 38:15.740
[Forbidden]

38:20.880 --> 38:23.460
You rat. Come out if you dare.

38:25.590 --> 38:27.210
Come in if you dare.

38:28.150 --> 38:30.130
You think it's safer, huh?

38:31.030 --> 38:32.690
[Forbidden]
This is Forbidden Land.

38:32.920 --> 38:35.340
Of course it's safer.

38:35.710 --> 38:36.820
Look behind you.

38:38.440 --> 38:40.380
That's a trick for kids.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.940
You think I'll fall for that?

38:48.150 --> 38:50.170
So what if I look?

39:20.070 --> 39:21.380
You should wear more.

39:29.230 --> 39:30.130
That's not cool.

39:31.000 --> 39:33.340
Left without saying goodbye.

39:35.400 --> 39:36.490
But rest easy this time.

39:37.920 --> 39:39.210
I won't kick your butt.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.570
Father always said

40:00.030 --> 40:01.260
Forbidden Land

40:01.510 --> 40:04.260
is the most treacherous place.

40:04.960 --> 40:06.420
Only here

40:07.550 --> 40:09.130
deserves to bury General Yecha.

40:17.840 --> 40:19.050
Over the ocean wide,

40:19.760 --> 40:20.940
you fought by my side.

40:21.920 --> 40:22.940
General Yecha.

40:24.880 --> 40:25.820
Go in peace.

40:25.840 --> 40:34.170
Go in peace.

40:35.110 --> 40:35.900
Farewell.

41:04.630 --> 41:05.820
Ao Jia, what are you doing?

41:07.230 --> 41:08.420
Just calm down.

41:10.190 --> 41:11.010
Why does everything I do

41:11.030 --> 41:12.300
seem so reckless to you?

41:12.710 --> 41:14.090
I'm completely sober.

41:14.550 --> 41:15.860
It's the Human Clan.

41:16.190 --> 41:18.690
Poisoning, killing, breaking our laws.

41:19.230 --> 41:20.980
My Yecha died for nothing.

41:21.150 --> 41:23.090
How can we not avenge this?

41:25.030 --> 41:26.420
I know what you'll say.

41:28.440 --> 41:29.980
For one brief moment,

41:32.550 --> 41:33.820
I even thought

41:34.320 --> 41:35.380
of dropping this.

41:35.840 --> 41:36.650
Peace

41:37.150 --> 41:38.210
between humans and dragons?

41:38.710 --> 41:40.530
What happened to this so-called peace?

41:40.800 --> 41:42.460
How did this "peace"

41:42.480 --> 41:44.530
end up killing General Yecha?

41:45.510 --> 41:46.690
Human-Dragon peace

41:48.070 --> 41:49.940
is nothing but a lie!

41:50.360 --> 41:51.530
All forces, heed my command.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.420
Aye.

41:52.920 --> 41:56.010
Kill any human on sight.

41:56.590 --> 41:59.490
We must stain the seas red.

42:00.230 --> 42:02.570
Only then can Yecha's soul rest.

42:03.480 --> 42:05.530
Only then do we honor our past.

42:05.960 --> 42:07.210
You're not doing this for Yecha.

42:08.000 --> 42:09.980
You just want an excuse for war.

42:10.400 --> 42:11.210
Pearl Elites.

42:11.510 --> 42:11.940
Stand down.

42:11.960 --> 42:12.740
Jiang Si'er.

42:15.360 --> 42:16.820
You are my fiancée.

42:18.070 --> 42:19.210
Pearl Elites

42:19.960 --> 42:21.530
should answer to my command too.

42:21.550 --> 42:22.980
You call a retreat and that's it?

42:23.280 --> 42:24.210
Then mark my words.

42:25.510 --> 42:26.260
Right now,

42:27.480 --> 42:28.780
I divorce you.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.740
What?

42:36.110 --> 42:37.340
We allied with dragons

42:38.030 --> 42:39.610
for peace.

42:40.070 --> 42:40.940
But now

42:41.880 --> 42:43.260
all I see is a lunatic

42:43.280 --> 42:44.860
killing innocents.

42:44.920 --> 42:46.420
My Mermaid Clan

42:46.880 --> 42:47.980
will have no part in this.

42:49.880 --> 42:50.530
Si'er.

42:51.760 --> 42:52.340
Si'er.

42:52.840 --> 42:53.260
Si'er.

42:54.400 --> 42:55.210
Jiang Si'er.

43:12.230 --> 43:13.420
What's so funny?

43:16.960 --> 43:19.820
You hypocritical butchers.

43:21.030 --> 43:23.690
General Yecha died an unjust death,

43:23.960 --> 43:25.570
yet you ignore the truth

43:25.590 --> 43:27.130
and frame humans for it.

43:27.150 --> 43:29.420
Isn't that ridiculous?

43:33.360 --> 43:33.820
Fine.

43:35.280 --> 43:35.570
Fine.

43:36.630 --> 43:38.650
Seems you care more about truth than me.

43:39.320 --> 43:40.210
Alright then.

43:42.590 --> 43:44.490
Why don't you go down and ask

43:44.510 --> 43:45.610
what the "truth" is?

43:46.840 --> 43:47.610
Now!

43:58.440 --> 44:00.300
The Primordial World

44:00.320 --> 44:02.940
faces a Great Tribulation.

44:03.760 --> 44:05.570
By then, heaven and earth
will be destroyed.

44:05.590 --> 44:07.460
Mountains of corpses
and seas of blood will arise.

44:08.320 --> 44:09.860
The Mortal Realm

44:09.880 --> 44:14.010
will turn to purgatory.

44:16.070 --> 44:17.740
So that's how it is.

44:57.490 --> 45:03.270
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

45:03.940 --> 45:10.640
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

45:12.170 --> 45:18.220
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

45:18.850 --> 45:25.300
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

45:26.040 --> 45:33.160
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

45:33.540 --> 45:40.440
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

45:40.820 --> 45:48.170
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

45:48.170 --> 45:55.340
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

46:11.480 --> 46:16.650
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

46:17.740 --> 46:24.760
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

46:25.950 --> 46:31.890
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

46:32.590 --> 46:39.670
♪Alas, our story is short♪

46:40.010 --> 46:47.120
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

46:47.440 --> 46:53.920
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

46:54.700 --> 47:01.910
♪Tearfully,
